# Supabase Configuration
# Both values enable live CMS reads. Leave both blank for explicit demo content.
# Contact/auth writes require a configured project; they never simulate success.
# Apply the reviewed local migration first; see SUPABASE_SETUP.md.
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your Supabase project values.
# NEVER commit .env or put service_role/secret keys here.

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

